  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2902.24 Excess emissions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2902.24 “Excess emissions” means the amount of emissions, rounded to the nearest whole ton, that are greater than the equivalent number of allowances available in the affected source’s compliance or overdraft account by the allowance transfer deadline for that year.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2903.25); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
